{"4194570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gray Space", "steam_appid": 4194570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAY SPACE</strong> is a first-person psychological survival horror where the environment is a direct reflection of your disintegrating sanity. As a scientist trapped in a decaying research facility, your intellect is your only weapon. Manage dwindling mental resources, solve high-stakes environmental puzzles, and survive the physical manifestation of your own terror. They said it would be &quot;just an experiment&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The clock is ticking. The antidote for humanity in the palm of your hand. Do not lose your mind.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💡 Key Features and Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧠 Sanity is a Resource:</strong> You are the only one in control of your headspace. Can you trust everything that you see?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛠️ Intellectual Survival:</strong> Use contextual intelligence to solve complex puzzles. Leverage the few tools that you find. Your brain is the primary survival tool; hammer and nails are secondary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📡 Unsettling:</strong> Experience a PSX-style aesthetic where low-poly meets modern psychological terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧪 Multiplayer Comms:</strong> You are part of a team. Coordinate and delegate your escape. Use each other to secure the extraction. And don't look back.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Do NOT drop the vial.</strong><br> <br><strong>📌 Wishlist GRAY SPACE Today!</strong>d̸o̶n̷'t̴ ̵t̵r̶u̶s̷t̶ ̷t̵h̴e̶ ̶b̸o̸a̴r̴d̴</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAY SPACE</strong> is a first-person psychological survival horror where the envir